+# Batch 47 authoring notes — Rigid Supersymmetric Backgrounds and Localization Data
+
+Run: \`advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23\`  
+Owned pair: \`qftx-susy-backgrounds\` / \`qftx-susy-backgrounds-examples\`  
+Scope: physics library, \`advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry\`, A-page order 1003.
+
+## Plan, inventory, and dependency levels
+
+The complete design at \`research/plan-advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry-track.md\` § “Rigid Supersymmetric Backgrounds and Localization Data” (lines 653–660) agrees with the selected \`research/plan-spec.json\` entries: title, category, \`library: physics\`, A/B IDs, and \`requires: [qftx-susy-extended-actions, qftx-equivariant-cohomology]\` all match. There is no design/plan conflict. The proposed A inventory contains \`def-qftx-susy-background-data\` and \`post-qftx-rigid-supersymmetric-background\`; the initial B list is empty only as a planning placeholder. Under the current owner direction, two B examples were authored.
+
+The current page-level dependency graph records batch 47 at level 5, requiring batches 7 and 31. The item levels use the item-level rule from the dispatch, not those page levels:
+
+| Item | In-run item suppliers and current levels | Assigned item level |
+|---|---|---:|
+| \`def-qftx-susy-background-data\` | none | 0 |
+| \`post-qftx-rigid-supersymmetric-background\` | \`def-qftx-susy-background-data\` (0), planned \`post-qftx-n4-super-yang-mills-model\` (proposed contract has no item deps; provisional 0), \`def-torus-equivariant-cohomology-cartan-model\` (2) | 3 |
