+      locator: "§2, equations (2.9)–(2.11): the rigid limit, fixed supergravity backgrounds, and the gravitino/Killing-spinor equations; §4, equation (4.1), for the distinct N=1 S4 reality qualification."
+    - title: "Vasily Pestun, Localization of Gauge Theory on a Four-Sphere and Supersymmetric Wilson Loops"
+      url: "https://arxiv.org/pdf/0712.2824"
+      locator: "§2, equations (2.5)–(2.14), (2.26)–(2.30); §4.1–§4.3, equations (4.1)–(4.15)."
