+
+Conventions: Pestun’s \((9,1)\) dimensional-reduction notation with Euclidean four-sphere, \(\Phi_0=i\Phi_0^E\), \(K_i=iK_i^E\), \(a_0=ia_0^E\), source gamma matrices, \(r\) of length, \(g_{\rm YM}\) dimensionless, and \(\varepsilon_1=\varepsilon_2=r^{-1}\). The \(SU(2)\) trace normalization is explicit and remains conditional on the absent N=4 model interface.
