+id: thm-qftx-complex-associated-bundle-realification
+kind: theorem
+title: Complex structure on an associated bundle by realification
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: mathematics
